---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import Display from '../components/Display.astro';
---
<Base>
<section class="hero container">
  <div class="hero-copy"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot"></span> MEET HEARTHBOARD DISPLAYS</div><h1>A little more<br /><em>home.</em></h1><p class="hero-description">The day's plans. A favorite photo. The little things worth keeping in view. Bring Hearthboard to a display that feels at home.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button primary" href="#choose">Find your display <Icon name="arrow" size={18}/></a><a class="text-link" href="/docs/">Explore the guides <Icon name="book" size={17}/></a></div><div class="hero-footnote"><span class="tiny-grid" aria-hidden="true">▦</span> Two kinds of display. One familiar Hearthboard.</div></div>
  <div class="hero-visual"><div class="visual-disc"></div><div class="visual-caption caption-top"><span class="caption-swatch ink-swatch"></span> A quieter kind of screen.</div><Display kind="ink" class="hero-ink"/><Display kind="frame" class="hero-frame"/><div class="visual-caption caption-bottom"><span class="caption-swatch frame-swatch"></span> A frame for your everyday.</div><span class="visual-sample">Illustrative dashboards · Sample content</span></div>
</section>
<div class="promise-strip"><div class="container"><span><Icon name="wifi" size={17}/> Pairs with Hearthboard on iPhone</span><span><Icon name="heart" size={17}/> Your home, at a glance</span><span><Icon name="book" size={17}/> A guide at every step</span></div></div>
<section id="choose" class="container section choose-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">MAKE ROOM FOR HEARTHBOARD</div><h2>Which display feels like you?</h2></div><p>Start with the hardware you have.<br />We'll help you take it from there.</p></div><div class="product-pair">
  <article class="product-card ink-card"><div class="product-art ink-art"><Display kind="ink"/><span class="art-tag">E-PAPER / ESP32</span></div><div class="product-info"><div class="product-title"><h3>Hearthboard Ink</h3><span class="pill">E-ink displays</span></div><p>A calm, paper-like home for your day. Bring a supported ESP32 e-paper board to life with our browser installer.</p><div class="product-meta"><span>7.5″ monochrome DIY kit</span><span>Install over USB</span></div><a class="button dark" href="/ink/">Meet Hearthboard Ink <Icon name="arrow" size={18}/></a></div></article>
  <article class="product-card frame-card"><div class="product-art frame-art"><Display kind="frame"/><span class="art-tag">ANDROID / PHOTO FRAMES</span></div><div class="product-info"><div class="product-title"><h3>Hearthboard Frame</h3><span class="pill">Android beta</span></div><p>A fresh purpose for your photo frame. Give a compatible Android display your photos, plans, weather, and more.</p><div class="product-meta"><span>Compatible Android frames</span><span>Install the app</span></div><a class="button dark" href="/frame/">Meet Hearthboard Frame <Icon name="arrow" size={18}/></a></div></article>
</div></section>
<section class="container journey-section section"><div class="journey-intro"><div class="eyebrow">FROM BOX TO BELONGING</div><h2>A few simple steps.<br />A familiar place.</h2><p>Your iPhone is the companion. Your display is where it all comes together.</p><a class="text-link" href="/docs/">Let's get you set up <Icon name="arrow" size={18}/></a></div><ol class="journey-list"><li><span>01</span><div><h3>Find your fit</h3><p>Check your exact board or frame against the compatibility guide.</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><h3>Make it Hearthboard</h3><p>Flash your e-paper board from a computer, or install the app on your Android frame.</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><h3>Make it yours</h3><p>Join Wi-Fi, pair with your iPhone, and choose what you'd like to keep in view.</p></div></li></ol></section>
<section class="container help-banner"><div><div class="eyebrow">A LITTLE HELP GOES A LONG WAY</div><h2>You're in good company.</h2><p>From your first connection to a fresh start, the guides are here.</p></div><a class="button primary" href="/docs/">Setup & support <Icon name="arrow" size={18}/></a></section>
</Base>
